card.text:
When ~ enters the battlefield gain control of target artifact or creature until ~ leaves the battlefield.
Whenever ~ attacks you may pay {3}{U}. If you do, put a copy of ~ onto the battlefield under your control, except it isn't legendary. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step.
Madness {2}{U}

At the beginning of your end step, if you control cards named Crown of the Sunken King, Crown of the Old Iron King, and Crown of the Ivory King you win the game.
Equipped creature has "You can't lose the game and your opponents can't win the game."
Equip {4}

Colored nonartifact permanents don't untap in their controllers untap step unless its controller pays {1} for each of them. (They choose which ones to pay for independently of the others.)
Equipped creature has "Whenever a colored nonartifact permanent is untapped you gain 1 lifeand get one soul."
Equip {1}

Colored nonartifact spells cost {1} more to cast.
Equipped creature has "Spells you control cost {1} less to cast."
Equip {2}

Whenever an ability is activated or triggered counter that ability unless its controller pays {1}. (Mana abilities can't be targeted.)
Equipped creature has "Sacrifice three artifacts: Search your library for a Dragon card, put it onto the battlefield. Shuffle your library. Activate only as a sorcery."
Equip {3}

When this equipment enters the battlefield create a 1/1 colorless Hollow creature token, then attach this to it.
Equipped creature gets +0/+3 and can't be the target of spells or abilities.
Equip {3}

When this equipment enters the battlefield create a 1/1 colorless Hollow creature token, then attach this to it.
Equipped creature gets +1/+0 and has "Whenever this creature attacks alone, it deals 1 damage to any target."
Equip {1}

When ~ enters the battlefield, create a 3/3 red Human creature token named Red Phantom. It has prowess.
Equipped creature gets +2/+2 and has vigilance, haste, and "Whenever equipped creature deals damage to a player exile the top card of your library with a favored counter on it. You may play a card in exile with a favored counter on it without paying its mana cost."
Equip {2}

At the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, ~ deals damage to that player equal to 4 minus the number of cards in their hand.
Equipped creature has "Whenever an opponent loses life, you gain that much life."
Equip {2}

When this equipment enters the battlefield create a 1/1 colorless Hollow creature token, then attach this to it.
Equipped creature has bleed. (If a player would be dealt damage by a source with bleed, they also get a bleed counter for each damage received)
Equip {2}
